# A PO file to review the msgfmt quality check in Virtaal.
# Each unit gets one of the messages libgettextpo's po_message_check_all()
# reports, which are what msgfmt -c reports; its comment has the message
# gettext 1.0 gives. Made by checking candidate units against libgettextpo
# 1.0: correct translations with one mistake added.
# 
# gettext numbers Python brace and Rust directives from 0 when it reports
# an unterminated or invalid directive, and from 1 otherwise.
# 
# The header gets "header field '%s' still has the initial default value".
# 
# Not shown, since they need a different header:
# - plural expression can produce division by zero
# - plural expression can produce integer overflow
# - plural expression can produce stack overflow
# - plural expression can produce negative values
# - nplurals = %lu but plural expression can produce values as large as %lu
# - Try using the following, valid for %s:
# - message catalog has plural form translations
# - but header entry lacks a "plural=EXPRESSION" attribute
# - but header entry lacks a "nplurals=INTEGER" attribute
# - invalid nplurals value
# - invalid plural expression
# - message catalog has plural form translations, but lacks a header entry with "Plural-Forms: nplurals=INTEGER; plural=EXPRESSION;"
# - header field '%s' missing in header
# 
# Not reached:
# - In the directive number %zu, the compound specifier consumes a variable number of arguments.
# - The directive number %zu references an argument after the last argument.
# - In the directive number %zu, the substring "%s" is not a valid date/time style.
# - The character that terminates the directive number %zu, for the conversion '%c', is not a valid conversion suffix.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Virtaal msgfmt check reference\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: \n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-10-10 14:55+0100\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-10-10 12:00+0100\n"
"Last-Translator: FULL NAME <EMAIL@ADDRESS>\n"
"Language-Team: LANGUAGE <LL@li.org>\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"X-Generator: Translate Toolkit 3.19.18\n"
"Language: af\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"

